{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は撮影会がありました！\n初の試みだったので不安でしたが\n楽しかったです〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後には皆様の前で挨拶も出来て\n良かった✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々のほうれん草コンビ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B.ハート"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"C.オリジナルポーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オリジナルポーズはいろいろ\nやりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昇格おめでとうのお花もあって\n嬉しかったです(T . T)\nありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ学校の卒業遠足として\nディズニーにクラスのみんなで\n行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでポップコーン食べて\n乗り物に並んで\n動画や写真もたくさん撮って..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学生らしいことをたくさん出来ました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも制服のスカートはやっぱり\n寒かった(T . T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとあと！\n私の食べたいアイスが\nまだ見つかってません(>_<)\n早く食べたい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しい鍋も教えてくれて\nありがとう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度メンバー誘って行ってみます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もつ鍋とキムチ鍋多かった！\n私も好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今気になるのは豆乳鍋〜(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の甥っ子、ちびっ子ギャングが\n自分で前髪を切ったせいで\nとても短くなっていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会った瞬間に私は大爆笑しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・BLT Graduation〜中学卒業〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山梨県に行き、雪の中での\n撮影でした。\n雪が積もらなきゃ出来ない\n貴重な体験もしました...‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ソロ撮影‼︎楽しかった‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"YouTubeにてメイキング映像も\nあがってます。\nぜひご覧ください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=OGPk82s41OE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月10日発売です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OFFショットは発売後に\nまたブログに載せます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ペアPV 1"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白石さんと橋本さんのペアPVに\nゲストとして出演させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中の撮影でしたが、\nお二人がかっこよすぎて...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょこっと映ってるので\n見つけてねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OFFショットはまた今度！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ペアPV 2"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈、佐々木、鈴木、寺田、山崎、渡辺\nの6人での撮影でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらもOFFショットはまた今度！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤衆人監督にまたまた\nお世話になりました〜\n楽しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらもぜひご覧ください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容詰め詰め\nふえええええええええい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絢音たんお誕生日おめでとう！\n久しぶりに会うといつも\n笑顔できてくれて癒されてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたい所あるから\n一緒に行こうね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはメール送ったので\nここでは書きません。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に質問返し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・この春から高校生ですが私の時は\n急に大人になった感じがしたのですが\n今の子はどうなんだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生から仕事面でも\nいろいろと活動の幅が広がるし、\n生活面でも少しは成長したいなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛はスポーツだったら何が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テニスが好きです。\n硬式テニス部だったので結構\n思い入れがあります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとバスケ！\nバスケはお兄ちゃんが\nやっていたのでシュートする所とか\nかっこいいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカー、野球も好きだな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛が乃木坂に入って正規メンバーになるまでの思い出はなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番最初のミニライブ。\nかりんとWセンターで\nやらせていただいた走れ!Bicycle。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様の反応が不安で怖かったけど\n笑顔で迎えてくれたり\n声援まで送ってくれたり\nあの光景は忘れられません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは去年の生誕祭。\n入場曲は私がオーディションの時に\n歌った気まぐれロマンティック。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんが考えて流してくれた\nと思ったのですが...\nなんと生誕委員の方々がこの曲を\n選んでくれたと知りここまで\n私の事を考えてくれていた\nことに感動しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルでは主役に\n選ばさせていただいたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほかにもたくさんあるけどね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/03/09/0349534/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はチェキ会！楽しみ♡\nどんな風に撮ろうかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また見てね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛"}],"source":"archive"}